Error [E0855]: Generic module instantiation forms a cycle: first -> second -> first
  --> tests/ui/genmod_cycle_indirect.jet:3:18
    |
  3 | module second :: first<Int>
    |                  ^^^^^
 Why: Module aliases must form an acyclic dependency graph so specialization reaches one stable result
 Fix: Break the cycle: first -> second -> first
